Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是萨姆  鲍比  他有点儿不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam, Bobby. He's just -- he's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我觉得有点儿不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  只是无法抛下你和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't just lose you and ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和本会呆在这儿  只要可以你随时都能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and ben will be here, and you come when you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但要完好无损地回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得这样行得通吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you really think we could pull something like that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值得一试啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你究竟怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:36.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -本  别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - Ben, just stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我听到你说...  -我叫你别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought I heard you...  - I said stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解药是坎贝尔家的古秘方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cure's an old Campbell recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么  我都能指望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, I can always count on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对吗  小萨姆  -当然  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- right, Sammy? - Of course, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他会打来  可那些话都是敷衍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he'd call, but of course he never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.79,0:01:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But -- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  我们俩处得挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just -- we had such a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是该打给他呢  你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I should call him, right? Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该打给他吗  我真不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, should I call him? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚  稍等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Uh, Olivia, just hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想知道真相  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need the truth. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真得挂了  好吗  稍候打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really gotta go, 'kay? Call you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我同情你  -你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I pity you. - I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可悲又可怜  所以我同情你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sad and pathetic, and I pity you --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.23,0:01:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才要给你提个醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only reason I'm giving you a head's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰蛤蛎浓汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from the clam chowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面可是放了我自己特有的  调味料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I flavored it with my own... seasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道新来的姑娘美斯狄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that new girl, Misty?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比你辣多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way hotter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:01:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:01:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本上  她就是个尤物  而你就是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, she's an eight, and you're a...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:00.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三流水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}a three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么需要吗  夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you anything else, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有次开车撞倒了一个流浪汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran over a homeless man once,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都没停下来看看他是否还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I never even stopped to see if he was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想在她睡着时烧死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to burn her in her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么  但你真让我不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it is, but you just give me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像不舒服到想呕吐一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I get physically nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:39.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝望  愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate. Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孬种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个绝望又可悲的窝囊废\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a desperate, pathetic loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你能来接我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you come get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听起来糟透了  喝酒了吗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound awful. Have you been drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得自己快疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直要崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:03:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的没错  因为你就是个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are, 'cause you are a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:02.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're certifiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次电话一响  我的胃就会抽搐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time the phone rings, my stomach drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍又有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane with another crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.82,0:03:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俨然就是个活灾星\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a walking disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:13.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全家人都在等着你的下一次大崩溃  珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole family's just waiting for your next big breakdown, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们简直没有一刻自由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're like hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不干脆自杀得了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just go ahead and kill yourself already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(铁板烧烤&酒吧  大格尔森的快乐之地)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道自己看到了什么  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们试过他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tested him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盐  银器等等  所有都试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt, silver -- everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他任那个吸血鬼对我为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}He threw me to that vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你  那绝对不是我老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, it's not my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  他就是我们之前从没遇到过的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then he's something we ain't ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  或者就是他妈的路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or it's freakin' Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你召唤小卡了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然召唤了  但没任何回音\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course I called Cass. He's not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他的  我等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw him. I can't wait anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我明白  你有点惊慌失措\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it. You're rattled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:03:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得专业点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's be professional --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专业点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professional?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:03:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他眼睁睁地看着我被转化\N{\fnArial\fs30}He watched me get turned!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定那是你亲眼所见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you sure that's what you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  鲍比  我知道自己看见了啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Bobby, yes. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"你知道"可不等同于证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, "You know" ain't the same as proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们谈论的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're talking about --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在讨论如何处理这件事  而且要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about doing something about this, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅是吸血鬼这件事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just the vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他跳下去的那一刻他就变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been different from the jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去查资料  认认真真地查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hit the books, hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别一枪嘣了他呢  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't shoot him yet, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好看着他  我们需要了解实际情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch him. We need facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果那不是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause if it ain't Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们完全不知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且要想拿下他  我们也得知道方法才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we're gonna put him down, we need to know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:32.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至都不愿意跟他同车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even want to ride in the same car with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更别说跟他一起解决案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}much less work a damn case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我乖乖上车  他就是你的"案子"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car. He's your case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我刚刚  在给莉莎留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I was just, uh, I was leaving Lisa a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她还没回你电话吗  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Still hasn't called you back, huh? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真糟  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sucks. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我很好  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm fine. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个  你瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, look. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得事有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it might be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四个人  全都是在过去几周莫名自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four people, out of nowhere, all in the last couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  听起来确实有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么联邦调查局会对自杀案有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would federal investigators be interested in a suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个全新的  更爱民的管理机制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a new, more caring administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我已经跟警察都说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I already told the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍那天确实过得挺遭的  我也尽了姐姐职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane was having a really bad day, so I-I did what any sister would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:44.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  试着鼓励她振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...tried to cheer her up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她坚持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told her to hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么叫"说谎迹象"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what a "tell" is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是打牌术语  能说明人们何时在虚张声势\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a poker term... for when you're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你刚刚拨头发那一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what you just did with your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实交代你对你妹妹做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us what you did to your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.74,0:06:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:25.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想告诉她  "我爱你"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to tell her, "I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"我就在你身边"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for you."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.71,0:06:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是说出来的却是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but what came out was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"你这个累赘  你干脆自杀吧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You're a burden. Just kill yourself."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会说这么残忍的话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我就是停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I just couldn't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房子里有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}See anything in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有巫术袋和硫磺  也没有电磁反应  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hex bags, no sulfur, no emf. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个大号  还有今天的《编织》杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tuba and an issue of Crochet today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算哪门子有自杀倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, already kinda suicidal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是姐姐残忍的吐槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, and then big sis's taxicab confession
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她逼上了绝路\N{\fnArial\fs30}sends her over the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  到底是什么让姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, what made big sis
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此无情地开口喷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}open her big, fat mouth in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  这确实是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that is the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  能拿点纱布给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Uh, can you grab some gauze, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真该让你给我开点安定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've had you prescribe me a valium.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.99,0:07:24.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  保罗  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to be honest, Paul --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不想来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人愿意来这里  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and most people. But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:34.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会放在心上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't take it personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  张开嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和堂娜有空应该来吃顿晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Donna should come over for supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都多久没来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  最难受的步骤完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Worst part's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我其实不喜欢堂娜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really into Donna anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妻子风韵犹存呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife looks great for her age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她松弛的皮肤让我想吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her saggy skin makes me want to hurl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:07:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  我有欲望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have urges, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:07:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得那次露营我没去吗  我说我生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that camping trip I missed 'cause I was sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是害怕和梅利莎在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just afraid to be around Melissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我女儿梅利莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter Melissa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是后来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她晚上参加了吉尔的睡衣晚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}She spent the night for Jill's slumber party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.09,0:08:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切似乎轻而易举\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just seemed so easy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是我无法控制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not so much I couldn't control myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是我知道不会被人发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just knew I wouldn't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实也没人发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do you find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一整晚都在查资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been up all night lookin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还能提供点别的线索不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got anything else to go on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和他共处一室  让我毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my skin crawls being in the same room with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以查查这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you look that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想办法啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我不知道我还能坚持多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much longer I can do this, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须尽快弄清楚他到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to figure out what the hell he is and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  迪恩  情形很不妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean, there's a worst-case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  撒旦是我的搭档吗  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Satan's my co-pilot? Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  那是另一个不妙的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that'd be the other worst case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能就是萨姆自己的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's just Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -鲍比  给你一天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - You got a day, Bobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我就自己动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm handling this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(莉莎)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又出现一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牙医钻死了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dentist drilled a guy to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:10:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的  不是在床上那个"钻"吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the...non-sexy kind of drilling, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌五十块  他肯定与此事有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 bucks says he's mixed up in all the crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你这么肯定  -是啊  我们去和他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think? - Yeah. Let's go talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.05,0:10:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先去吧  我马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go ahead? I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还要做点调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do a little research.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  得搞清楚我们对付的是什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We got to know what we're up against, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.82,0:10:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  好  好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(警局)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钻子男有啥线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything from Marathon Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我来之前他在牢房里上吊自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hung himself in his cell before I could get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎哟喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他肯与此事有牵连\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was definitely involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:10:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚从他助手那里挖到一点线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got the scoop from his assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.89,0:11:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧  当时他的病人对他坦白的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say the stuff that his patient was confessing to --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换做我  我也会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have murdered him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  牙齿穿洞男和吃枪子小妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, root canal and russian roulette --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个好像都被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}both of 'em, it's like they were cursed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们被迫要向他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, people are just compelled
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吐槽各种实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}to puke the truth all over 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被丑陋的事实打击  然后就走极端了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, getting hit with the ugly truth, you go postal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那确实是诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd call that a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去太平间查看尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the morgue to check out the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:20.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去牙医的办公室  看看有何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take the dentist's office, see what you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(变幻化妖)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(哈里号角之家)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(哈里号角之家)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(哈里号角之家)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍和康利医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane and Dr. Conley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说了  太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard. Awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  你是他们唯一的共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly? You're the only thing they have in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们死之前  和你说过什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they say anything to you before they, uh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是打听一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I was just fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我的号如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, by the way, how 'bout my horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.94,0:12:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失窃的号啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stolen horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们还在查呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Yeah. We're -- we're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望如此吧  那可是稀罕物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope so. Thing's one-in-a-billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么说它是稀罕物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes it one-in-a-billion again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是老古董了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a museum piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.74,0:12:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说  已经有一千年的历史了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And near as anyone can tell, about a thousand years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:03.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它来自哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无人知晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.19,0:13:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候被偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did it get swiped?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概\N{\fnArial\fs30}About...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}two weeks ago --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是珍死的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}same day Jane died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.05,0:13:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(加百列真理之号)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.88,0:13:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里可能有重杀伤性的天使武器哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible loose nuke down here, angelic weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事儿应该你们管吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda your department.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  听到了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在戒备萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been on red alert about Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却为这个该死的号来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you come for some stupid horn?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我  我就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me to be here, and I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋  我都召唤你好几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- I've been asking you to be here for days, you dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆的事  我没有出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come about Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我没什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I have nothing to offer about Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好啊  因为我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's great, because for all we know,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:13:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是包了个包装的路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just gift wrap for Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:13:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.37,0:14:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果路西法逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer escaped the cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会感应到\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  迪恩  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你原来更像人类  至少有点人情味\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to be human, or at least like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在交战状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certain...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些令人懊悔的事需要我去完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}regrettable things are now required of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:44.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加百列的真理之号  这东西是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Gabriel's horn of truth? That's a real thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.87,0:14:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你见过了吗  -我想就在这镇子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've seen it? - I think it's in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某个东西在强迫人们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's forcing people...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得  不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, you're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是真理之号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't the horn of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:14:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.35,0:15:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就消失了两秒钟  你都去哪儿看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gone for like two seconds. Where did you look?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪儿都看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便吧  很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nice seeing you, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:10.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's wrong with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我是真的想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I do want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会去打听一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make inquiries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:34.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我其实想看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'd actually like to see
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这周发生的所有自杀案的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the suicides that came in this week,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不光吉格斯医生(变态杀人魔)一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}not just Dr. Giggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that gonna be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个  他们  他们已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're -- they're already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.03,0:15:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被转移了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in transferred?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.07,0:15:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不算是啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能告诉我这是怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to tell me what's going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我应该跟你上级谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}or should I have a little chat with your supervisor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是...  消失了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in... Gone gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.79,0:16:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...掠夺性竞争削价\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Predatory prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是时事报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,获知本地队伍的最新获奖消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tune in weekdays for the newest addition
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请于工作日锁定本台\N{\fnArial\fs30}to our award-winning local team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彻底了解你待付余款的起居室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out the truth about your layaway living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一杯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  谢了  我在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, thanks. I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸体都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the bodies are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思  就凭空消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, they just vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,验尸官是这么说的  不过我找到了条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the coroner said. But I got a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一具失踪的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the missing bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比其他人早死了整整一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}she died a whole week before everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是自杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报告说是车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reported as a car accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过肯定是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no reason it couldn't have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:16:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说她是咱们要找的源头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then that would make her our patient zero, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:00.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想大概是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这东西是什么咒  都是从她开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever got this whole curse thing rolling started with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在在她家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at her place now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩汉街和159街交叉转角处\N{\fnArial\fs30}corner of Burnham and 159th.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分钟后到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, give me 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改注意了  再给我来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I will have that other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说你在工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you were working.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就指着它工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am working up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向当地专家询问  为您讲述真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to local experts to bring you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我请\N{\fnArial\fs30}On me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还想要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else I can get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要他妈的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just like the freakin' truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过再来一杯就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll settle for another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有时会觉得  我怀不上孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I think I can't get pregnant
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为上帝知道我的婚姻是个骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause god knows my marriage is a sham.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:55.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:17:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我每天都要吸镇痛剂的粉末\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've been snorting oxy all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这种姿势坐着  是想让你看到我的胸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sitting like this so you'll look at my breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚隆的  我需要很多人的关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just bought them. I need a lot of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你加油哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  你有什么想告诉我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, anything you're itchin' to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉让你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:55.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是检验一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just testing a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.85,0:18:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿边啃书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm here hittin' the books
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,边喝牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}while drinking a nice glass of milk
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:02.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在看"托瑞和迪恩"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watching "Tori & Dean."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥  谁和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh-- wait, w-who and Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托瑞·斯佩林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tori Spelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是她超级粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a huge fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姑娘老有才了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl's a real talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想在电话里是管用的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I guess it does work over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道还有啥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我偶尔会修修脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get a pedicure once in a while --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个越南店真的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This nice vietnamese joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay, please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:22.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那妞儿  阿凤\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one gal, nhung phuong --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是"丝绒凤凰"的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name means "Velvet phoenix."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人很袖珍  不过那手法啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiny thing, but the grip on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:29.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她从我脚趾开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}She starts on my toes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:30.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉我要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I feel like I am gonna --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  行了吧  我那玻璃心都终身创伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa! Hey, come on, m-- now I'm scarred for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜你所赐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没告诉过别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told anyone that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I telling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能我比较偏爱你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe 'cause you're my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使萨姆当猎手更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, Sam's a better hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然是最近变强的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lately, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  我他妈干嘛要告诉你这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Why the hell am I tellin' you this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.81,0:19:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-诅咒  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cursed? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不明白了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:55.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一半时间  你明明是去解决问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that half the time you clean a mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果却惹一身腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}you end up dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  这可能是这阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, this might be the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我碰到的最好的事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}best thing that's happened to me in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你要干什么傻事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what damn fool move are you about to --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.84,0:20:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我初恋女友其实是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But did you know my first girlfriend turned out to be a --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨姆  有事留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam. Leave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我正在去找你的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm on my way to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我到之前你听到了留言  打回给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you get this before then, give me a call back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点事要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a few things I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.07,0:20:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一场车祸而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why is there an investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.87,0:20:36.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a car accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科莉是自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corey committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.35,0:20:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾怀疑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.14,0:20:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失礼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:55.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道科莉为什么自杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you had some idea Corey might have taken her own life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她最近在学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... She had been going through a bit of a hard time lately...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.93,0:21:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不太好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.69,0:21:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  她的小猫咪咪还跑丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, um, her cat, Mittens, had just ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, really
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的原因是她男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她确定他在外边偷腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sure that he was cheating on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.53,0:21:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他精于善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was just very good at covering his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:30.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就让她  执著于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, of course, made her completely obsessed with --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.61,0:21:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能看下她的房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I check out her room?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.21,0:21:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你打过电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.... I saw you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  那次的事太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's been crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.36,0:22:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本连提都不愿提起那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben won't even talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa, I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.49,0:22:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is actually the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.39,0:22:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在不是交流的好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}worst time in the universe to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们晚点再说好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}C-can we do this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:21.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你推了我的孩子  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoved my kid, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是现在就把事情说清楚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we do this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.89,0:22:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无从解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't really explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.93,0:22:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要听实话是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心里有太多秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got so much buried in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你努力把它们埋藏在心底\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you push it down, and you push it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.43,0:22:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you honestly think
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.57,0:22:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能这样安心生活下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you can go through life like that and not freak out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:22:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠半夜喝个几百毫升的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, what, drink half a fifth a night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.26,0:23:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就能忘记过去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你嫁的是个什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew what you signed up for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.15,0:23:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但我没想到萨姆会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But I didn't expect Sam to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.14,0:23:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我真的高兴他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm glad he's okay. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.39,0:23:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但从他踏进我们家门的时刻起  我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the minute he walked through that door, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.13,0:23:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.48,0:23:14.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们兄弟俩经历的是我这辈子见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two have the most unhealthy, tangled-up, crazy thing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.57,0:23:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最离奇的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他活在你的生命里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as long as he's in your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.01,0:23:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就永远得不到幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're never gonna be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想说得这么难听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That came out so much harsher than I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.07,0:23:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是想阻止你接近萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying don't be close to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.66,0:23:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我妹妹也很亲密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm close to my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.73,0:23:36.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但要是她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she got killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不会把她复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't bring her back from the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Lis...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.94,0:23:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.26,0:23:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟萨姆  我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, me and Sam, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.27,0:23:46.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间太过纠结\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毋庸质疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.35,0:23:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and Ben --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.12,0:23:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本和我  不能跟你淌这滩浑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Ben can't be in this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.36,0:23:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.66,0:24:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我深表遗憾啊  咪咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Mittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.07,0:24:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪了  我有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where you been? I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.73,0:24:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事一会再说  我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can wait. We got to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.10,0:24:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事我一直想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a few things I want to ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.80,0:24:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得实话实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, you're gonna tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.98,0:24:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  迪恩  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, Dean. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.33,0:24:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.51,0:24:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你是说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Are you saying you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.32,0:24:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.82,0:24:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你猜怎么着  愿望成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? I'm getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.53,0:25:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经说了  我有些事要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, like I said, I have a few questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.87,0:25:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当那个吸血鬼攻击我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that vamp attacked me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.85,0:25:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么只是站在一旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}why did you just stand there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.29,0:25:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.43,0:25:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我动弹不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.80,0:25:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你动不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来以后就跟个终结者似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been terminator since you got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.48,0:25:30.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道  可能是太震惊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Shock?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.25,0:25:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后就太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.57,0:25:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对此我非常懊恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel terrible about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.41,0:25:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在不可能说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lie here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.90,0:25:49.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.67,0:25:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会故意让那种事发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would let something like that happen on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.28,0:25:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我哥哥  你怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my brother. H-how could you even --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.15,0:25:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.19,0:26:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.63,0:26:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  以为  我看到些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I thought -- I thought I saw something. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是我看走眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.55,0:26:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天真是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just been a really, really bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.74,0:26:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.43,0:26:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有我  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your back, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.05,0:26:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.71,0:26:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是那小妞曾经的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this was the chick's pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.77,0:26:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她鬼迷心窍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she was obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.67,0:26:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你是说她疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you mean crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.17,0:26:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  猫头骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so cat skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.95,0:26:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩洛哥豆蔻种子  荚莲树皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, grains-of-paradise seed, devil's shoestring.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.64,0:26:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混在一起  就是个召唤术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mix 'em well, you got yourself a summoning spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.25,0:26:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,召唤恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.20,0:27:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,召唤天神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.53,0:27:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科莉对她男友的精神背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corey was so desperate for the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太渴望得到真相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}about her boyfriend's cheating heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.69,0:27:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她到处打听\N{\fnArial\fs30}she went digging around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.92,0:27:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing panned out,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.12,0:27:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是就换了种方式寻求帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she went looking for a different kind of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.95,0:27:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也就此打开了一扇难以关闭之门  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Opened a door she couldn't close. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.04,0:27:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在镇上只要有人要求得知真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now anyone in town who asks aloud for the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会召唤出真相女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}invokes Veritas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.73,0:27:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然她不是给完就算\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she doesn't just give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.11,0:27:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会用真相打击你  直到你自我了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}She slams you with it until you kill yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.56,0:27:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为她的贡品\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she gets her tribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.25,0:27:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些消失在停尸间的就是"贡品"\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, all that "Tribute" vanishing from the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.11,0:27:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看  像《超世纪谍杀案》的情节吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, uh, Soylent-Green situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天神也要进食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods got to eat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.95,0:27:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说要么把她干掉  要么你被吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means we got to take her out or you're on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.68,0:27:33.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  除了疯狂的猫女\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, what do we know,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}besides crazy cat lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.17,0:27:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-狗是她的软肋  -合情合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, dogs are her Achilles heel. - Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.12,0:27:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她曾经是位亲力亲为的女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was a pretty hands-on goddess back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.47,0:27:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her thing was coming down from the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.17,0:27:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向人们吐露真言\N{\fnArial\fs30}to speak truth to the masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.14,0:27:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可她不满足于贡品  她想要受到崇拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted more than tribute. She wanted to be worshipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.83,0:27:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想受人瞩目的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}An attention whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.82,0:27:50.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要这么理解也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to put it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.21,0:27:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说  21世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is the 21st-century version
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.34,0:27:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对大众吐露真言的常用方法是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}of speaking truth to the masses?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.15,0:28:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得这个神化身成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you really think this god is slumming
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山寨版的戴安·索耶吗(著名ABC新闻记者)\N{\fnArial\fs30}as some farm-league Diane Sawyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.01,0:28:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当是我的直觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, call it a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.08,0:28:24.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是艾士莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ashley --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.49,0:28:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.49,0:28:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是艾士莉·弗兰克  欢迎收看"吐露真言"节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ashley Frank, bringing you "Frank talk."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.13,0:28:31.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重来一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.81,0:28:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是艾士莉·弗兰克  欢迎收看"吐露真言"节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ashley Frank, bringing you "Frank talk."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.86,0:28:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重来一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.40,0:28:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是艾士莉·弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ashley Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:41.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有机蔬菜真的货真价实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are organic fruits and veggies really worth the cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.42,0:28:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她真吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.72,0:28:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光看头发就够吓人的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the hair alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.94,0:28:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道  伙计  也许根本没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. Maybe there's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.17,0:28:49.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在录了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we -- we're spinning?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.03,0:28:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的租赁拥有价格...\N{\fnArial\fs30}do the new rent-to-own prices...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.28,0:28:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家具商店的最新趋势...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...a recent trend in furniture stores...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.28,0:28:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在购买大宗物品之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}...But think twice before you decide to buy --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.36,0:28:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请三思而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you make that big purchase...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.36,0:29:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.16,0:29:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们自己问问议员吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll ask the councilman ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.65,0:29:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在拍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we still rolling?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.55,0:29:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.19,0:29:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.36,0:29:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放大那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoom in on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.66,0:30:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外表看着挺正常吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks pretty normal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.28,0:30:14.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面肯定见不得人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure inside it's chock full of creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.37,0:30:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.61,0:30:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.23,0:30:27.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是什么  -狗血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that's...? - Dog's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.34,0:30:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该不该问你从哪儿弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I even want to know where you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.21,0:30:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是别问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.82,0:30:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.41,0:31:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里见不得人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's all the creep?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.68,0:32:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吃晚餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.76,0:32:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.15,0:32:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着就轮到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.88,0:33:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舌头...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tongue...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.68,0:33:07.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是最美味的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the tastiest part.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.45,0:33:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是谎言诞生的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where the lies roll off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.04,0:33:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等不及要吃你们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot wait to eat yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.84,0:33:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前见过不少骗子  但你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've seen liars before, but you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可真是谎言专家啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.92,0:33:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是这职业的光荣之处啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point of professional pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.28,0:33:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换作是我  我可不会这么傲慢  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be so cocky if I were you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.96,0:33:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道充满谎言的生活会是什么下场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what happens when you base your life on lies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.63,0:33:40.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦真相大白就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth comes along and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.16,0:33:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  趁着你们还能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, while you've still got your tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝也知道你们心有积怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows you've got an earful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.58,0:33:53.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就说出来听听吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's your turn to spill some.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.96,0:33:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们不如来玩玩真心话真心话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout we play a little truth or truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.93,0:34:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该先问迪恩些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we ask Dean first, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.21,0:34:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些..\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.70,0:34:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于你的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.03,0:34:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我很想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.38,0:34:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对你弟弟的真实想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you really feel about your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.97,0:34:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.67,0:34:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天我还想趁他睡着时杀了他来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of yesterday, I wanted to kill him in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.79,0:34:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前我觉得他是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.41,0:34:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.50,0:34:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you think what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.41,0:34:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他其实就和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just acting like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.27,0:34:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.47,0:34:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.12,0:34:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗜血无数  最后只能血债血还\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're covered in blood until you're covered in your own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.05,0:34:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很多次  你差点就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half the time, you're about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.41,0:34:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.40,0:34:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉自己想要摆脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told myself I wanted out...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I wanted a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.53,0:34:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你在自欺欺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.57,0:35:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.00,0:35:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我真正擅长的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I'm good at...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.34,0:35:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是割喉取命\N{\fnArial\fs30}is slicing throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.27,0:35:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不好父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:12.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.30,0:35:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点无法改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no changing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.63,0:35:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.93,0:35:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以萨姆回到了你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Sam walking back into your life
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.56,0:35:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说肯定是种解脱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}must have been a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.05,0:35:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.05,0:35:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩真是天生一对(电影中的情侣连环杀手)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mallory to your Mickey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.46,0:35:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再次重逢的感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you feel about the band getting back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.27,0:35:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.35,0:35:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.48,0:35:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.21,0:35:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.88,0:36:03.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们彼此照应\N{\fnArial\fs30}but...We watch out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.63,0:36:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才最为重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.47,0:36:14.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.87,0:36:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.40,0:36:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.73,0:36:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己也说了  我不能说谎  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You said yourself -- I can't lie. 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.75,0:36:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.63,0:36:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.65,0:36:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.29,0:36:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.70,0:36:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么东西  他是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you? What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.91,0:36:33.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.35,0:36:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我强烈怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.68,0:36:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你所说的话我一句都不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt anything that comes out of your mouth right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.16,0:36:40.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.98,0:36:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.53,0:36:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.89,0:36:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.77,0:37:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.10,0:37:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.26,0:37:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.14,0:37:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.98,0:37:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.78,0:37:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  求你了  听我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, please, just let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.57,0:38:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼的我干嘛要相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell should I believe anything you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.41,0:38:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你要知道真相吗  我这就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. You want the truth? Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.92,0:38:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝作证  我说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is. God's honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.06,0:38:06.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.71,0:38:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确出了问题  很不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something wrong with me, really wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经有一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.62,0:38:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我骗了你  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied to you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.49,0:38:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看着你被变成了吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...I let you get turned by that vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.84,0:38:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道有解药  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I knew there was a cure, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.74,0:38:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们必须进入吸血鬼的巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we needed in that nest!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.51,0:38:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你能挺过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I knew you could handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.71,0:38:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.01,0:38:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可能会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've died!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.60,0:38:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能会杀死本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've killed Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.10,0:38:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不该这么冷酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that should stop me cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.12,0:38:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I -- I just don't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.79,0:38:33.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.82,0:38:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从我回来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since I came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.41,0:38:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我成了比以前更棒的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a-a better hunter than I've ever been!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.99,0:38:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing scares me anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.01,0:38:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我没有了任何感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I can't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.06,0:38:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.19,0:38:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.26,0:38:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help.
